<h1 id="DownHeading" class="firstHeading" lang="en"><span dir="auto">Download</span></h1>
<div id="fHContent">
Your <a href="//www.cgsecurity.org/testdisk-7.2.win64.zip">download</a> should begin shortly.
Please click the link in case it doesn't start.<br />
</div>
<h1 id="SBSHeading" class="firstHeading" lang="en"><span dir="auto">Step by step guide</span></h1>
<div id="sHContent">
<ul><li><a href="/testdisk.pdf" title="TestDisk &amp; PhotoRec documentation">Documentation (PDF format)</a>: Partition recovery, file undelete, file recovery, filesystem repair...</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/TestDisk_Step_By_Step" title="TestDisk Step By Step">TestDisk</a>: Partition recovery, file undelete</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/PhotoRec_Step_By_Step" title="PhotoRec Step By Step">PhotoRec</a>: File recovery</li>
</ul></div>
	<div id="siteNotice"></div>
	<div class="mw-indicators">
	</div>
	<h1 id="firstHeading" class="firstHeading mw-first-heading"><span class="mw-page-title-main">Donation</span></h1>
	<div id="bodyContent" class="vector-body">
		<div id="siteSub" class="noprint">From CGSecurity</div>
		<div id="contentSub"></div>
		<div id="contentSub2"></div>
		<div id="jump-to-nav"></div>
		<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#mw-head">Jump to navigation</a>
		<a class="mw-jump-link" href="#searchInput">Jump to search</a>
		<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content mw-content-ltr" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="mw-parser-output"><div class="thumb tright"><div class="thumbinner" style="width:302px;"><a href="/wiki/File:Christophe_GRENIER.jpg" class="image"><img alt="" src="/mw/images/thumb/Christophe_GRENIER.jpg/300px-Christophe_GRENIER.jpg" decoding="async" width="300" height="413" class="thumbimage" srcset="/mw/images/thumb/Christophe_GRENIER.jpg/450px-Christophe_GRENIER.jpg 1.5x, /mw/images/thumb/Christophe_GRENIER.jpg/600px-Christophe_GRENIER.jpg 2x" /></a>  <div class="thumbcaption"><div class="magnify"><a href="/wiki/File:Christophe_GRENIER.jpg" class="internal" title="Enlarge"></a></div>Christophe GRENIER</div></div></div>
<p>TestDisk and the other utilities are, and will remain, free software. I am a
strong believer in the free/GPL software concept.<br />
Any time spent on TestDisk and the other utilities is time I am not doing paid
work for something else, and sometimes that's a lot of time! This includes
continuing development as well as answering queries and providing support to
current and prospective users.<br />
Therefore if you've used <a href="/wiki/TestDisk" title="TestDisk">TestDisk</a>, <a href="/wiki/PhotoRec" title="PhotoRec">PhotoRec</a> and the other utilities and have found them
useful, and maybe feel like giving something back and contributing to the cause
then please feel free to click on one of the links below.
</p>
<ul><li>Feel free to donate an amount of your choice</li></ul>
<p class="mw-empty-elt"></p><form name="form_paypal" action="https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="cmd" value="_donations" />
<input type="hidden" name="business" value="grenier@cgsecurity.org" />
<input type="hidden" name="item_name" value="Thanks for TestDisk, PhotoRec, CmosPwd..." />
<input type="hidden" name="no_shipping" value="1" />
<input type="hidden" name="no_note" value="0" />
<input type="hidden" name="lc" value="US" />
<input type="hidden" name="cn" value="Donation notes" />
<label style="vertical-align:middle;">Donate</label><input type="text" name="amount" value="25" size="4" />
<select name="currency_code" id="input_currency_code" size="1" style="vertical-align:middle;">
<option value="EUR" selected="selected">EUR - €</option>
<option value="USD">USD - $</option>
</select>
<input type="image" src="/donate.png" alt="Donate" name="submit" />
<input type="hidden" name="tax" value="0" />
<input type="hidden" name="cancel_return" value="https://www.cgsecurity.org/wiki/Donation?donation=ko" />
<input type="hidden" name="return" value="https://www.cgsecurity.org/wiki/Donation?donation=ok" />
</form><p>
Your credit card donation will be processed by PayPal.
</p><p class="mw-empty-elt"></p>
<ul><li>You can also donate by bitcoin <img alt="Bitcoin logo" src="/mw/images/thumb/Bitcoin_logo.png/20px-Bitcoin_logo.png" decoding="async" title="Bitcoin logo" width="20" height="20" srcset="/mw/images/thumb/Bitcoin_logo.png/30px-Bitcoin_logo.png 1.5x, /mw/images/thumb/Bitcoin_logo.png/40px-Bitcoin_logo.png 2x" /></li></ul>
<table>
<tbody><tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="bitcoin:1ARSFLbrHdfLvqmkyQMJyvWWwBxcgM4gag?amount=0.1&amp;label=CGSecurity" title="1ARSFLbrHdfLvqmkyQMJyvWWwBxcgM4gag" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener"><img alt="1ARSFLbrHdfLvqmkyQMJyvWWwBxcgM4gag" src="/mw/images/thumb/Bitcoin.png/100px-Bitcoin.png" decoding="async" width="100" height="100" srcset="/mw/images/thumb/Bitcoin.png/150px-Bitcoin.png 1.5x, /mw/images/thumb/Bitcoin.png/200px-Bitcoin.png 2x" /></a></div></div>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>1ARSFLbrHdfLvqmkyQMJyvWWwBxcgM4gag
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<ul><li>My Amazon wish list can be found on <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://www.amazon.fr/hz/wishlist/ls/3RJB6AKCR77KD">Amazon (FR)</a> web site. Usually there is no shipping cost, <b>avoid Chronopost "éclair" shipping</b>.</li></ul>
<p>Thank you very much for your support.<br />
&#160;&#160;Christophe
</p>
</div>
